==Event==
*During this campaign, the 11-capsule draw option in the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] menu is replaced by a Step Up option with three steps.
**Step 1: 300 [[Cat Food]] for 3 draws.
**Step 2: 750 Cat Food for 5 draws, plus a 1 million XP bonus.
**Step 3: 1050 Cat Food for 7 draws, plus a 1 million XP bonus. In addition, the 7th unit is guaranteed to be an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]].
***Note: Any Uber Rare Cat obtained before the 7th draw is determined by regular Cat Capsule chances and is '''not''' the guaranteed Uber Rare. So with luck, you can get more than 1 Uber Rare Cat on Step 3.
*After 30 minutes, or after Step 3 is completed, progress for this offer will reset to Step 1.
*Only Uber Rare Characters that can be obtained from the current Rare Cat Capsule event are guaranteed during this campaign.
*This campaign always appears during the [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]], [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]], [[WAVE BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|WAVE BUSTERS]], [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] and [[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]] events, but has also appeared during certain collaboration events.

